    "text": "A block is kept on a frictionless inclined surface with angle of inclination $\\alpha$. The incline is given an acceleration a to keep the block stationary. Then a is equal to\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/8QUqa18Bz2fS4Mlal1h_kTqNGwPMlm4Mt9Ki_9ensL4.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
