    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/Nr8tQA4wsbI7tS_tirq2s3XWu3Y21ii-aHxkmy7aZuo.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$m g \\sin \\alpha=m a \\cos \\alpha$\n$\\therefore \\mathrm{a}=\\mathrm{g} \\tan \\alpha$",
